'''Roderick''' '''Deon''' '''Hampton Jr.''' (born February 7, 2001) is an American professional [[basketball]] player for the [[Changsha Yongsheng]] of the [[National Basketball League (China)|National Basketball League]] in China. He was a five-star [[college recruiting|recruit]] at [[Little Elm High School]] in Little Elm, Texas. He was drafted by the [[Milwaukee Bucks]] as the 24th overall pick in the [[2020 NBA draft]].
